target/
.git/
docs/
tests/
examples/
scripts/
.github/
*.md

# vendor/ holds the patched grammar crates named by [patch.crates-io] in
# Cargo.toml, so the build cannot resolve the manifest without it.  Re-included
# wholesale because the `*.md` rule above would otherwise strip each crate's
# README, and `docs/` its own subdirectories.
!vendor/**
